## Deploy Your First Model
# Create a Project
# Discover > 'GPT-4.1-mini' for light weight task > Deploy
# i choose default settings

# Set instructions for the model.
# Add prompts to test its behavior.
# Save the configuration as an Agent for use in workflows.
# You can add tools from where your agent can get information from.
# Save agent

## Create an agent
# Click 'Build' > Click New Agent. 
# Give the agent a name e.g Support-Agent

## Configure Your Agent’s Behaviour e.g
You are an AI assistant that extracts key details from invoices.
Always return the results in this structure:
Invoice Number:
Supplier:
Date:
Total Amount:

# Save

## Test prompt
# Extract details from this invoice: Invoice 7781 from BlueWave Ltd for £2,195 dated 12/04/2024.